<title>INDIA: India's BHEL 1st half 96/97 net up.</title>
<headline>India's BHEL 1st half 96/97 net up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     687.20  vs    486.80</p>
<p>    Sales		 20,408.7   vs 17,757.20</p>
<p>    Other income	 1,287.90  vs  1,432.40</p>
<p>    Expenditure	 19,554.50  vs 17,418.90</p>
<p>    Interest		 453.60  vs    475.50</p>
<p>    Depreciation	   482.90  vs    483.90</p>
<p>    Tax			518.40  vs    324.50</p>
<p>NOTE: India's state-ru Bharat Heavy Electricals Ltd released the half-yearly results on Friday.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
